["er.request/1",{"arguments":{"body":"## Outcome\n\nEvidence on a tree store is an Entity Runtime observation at the artifact's current revision:\nit does not advance the revision, and evidence on one branch with a move on another does not\nfork the artifact (design § 4.1, review N7).\n\n## Why it is not built yet\n\nEntity Runtime 0.21.0 has `BatchAction::Observe` and `Store::observe`, and an observation leaves\nthe revision unchanged, but `walk_branches` (`entity-store/src/asynchronous/verify.rs`) counts\nevery record without a successor as a head, observations included. Measured: an observation on\none branch and a move on another report the artifact as forked after the merge. The Entity\nRuntime change that makes only decisions heads is in progress; this story follows its release.\n\nSwitching also changes what `move`, `explain` and `history` read, since evidence counts come\nfrom the packed `document` events today.\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"move-status","decided_on":"{\"recorded\":{\"test_result\":1}}","target":"ent-f0c60685652ee7b2e99484a8d911f169","to":"implemented"},"changed":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790266783934,"id":"ent-f0c60685652ee7b2e99484a8d911f169","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/evidence-is-an-observation-on-a-tree-store","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":4,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790273870625}},"status":"implemented"},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"active","id":"ent-f0c60685652ee7b2e99484a8d911f169","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790273870625,"causation":"cmd-child-bd467d0b1581c5c52b6f877ff7b877de10e383c3e3d3c966ab6e497251b9d216","correlation":"protocol-artifact-move","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-f0c60685652ee7b2e99484a8d911f169@4#0~db46322c07618f50","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-24T18:17:50Z"},"revision":4,"to_state":"implemented","type":"aep.status.move/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"crea